              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4356&=2^2\\times3^2\\times11^2\\\\4356&=(2\\times3\\times11)^2\\\\\\sqrt{4356}&=2\\times3\\times11\\\\\\sqrt{4356}&=66\\end{align*}$$",
